// check: no leaks
// Seventy sibling instantiations of a generic class whose field initializer throws its type
// argument: the catch sees all seventy errors. Only instantiations that grow (whose type
// arguments contain an enclosing instantiation's) are limited, so siblings all count (#372).

class E1 extends Error {}

class E2 extends Error {}

class E3 extends Error {}

class E4 extends Error {}

